<title>UK: Bear Stearns leads 2.024 bln Ffr two-tranche bond.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns leads 2.024 bln Ffr two-tranche bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche bond</p>
<p>was announced lead manager Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORIA-3</p>
<p>CLASS A1</p>
<p> AMT    1.012 BLN FFR COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    25.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.688    PAY DATE    25.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.275     REOFFER    99.688    SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p>CLASS A2</p>
<p> AMT    1.012 BLN FFR COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    25.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.543    PAY DATE    25.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.30	REOFFER    99.543    SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE ARE ALSO CLASS B NOTES OF 175.9 MLN FFR DUE</p>
<p>		25.JUN.04, 6M PIBOR +25 BP, ISSUE AND REOFFER AT</p>
<p>		PAR, LEAD MANAGED BY PARIBAS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
